            </note>
            <note corresp="#d300-f3" n="15" xml:id="d300-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram No. 3408, Jan. 29, 1916, 10 p. m., from the Ambassador in Germany, <ref
                        target="frus1916Supp#pg_153">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, p. 153</ref>.</p>
            </note>
